@startuml AllComponents_Class

left to right direction

rectangle Controller {
    class ControllerAggregate {}
    struct Event {}
    rectangle Handlers {
        class InitHandler {}
        class RuntimeHandler {}
        class ErrorHandler {}
    }
}

rectangle AudioProcessor {
    class AudioProcessorAggregate {}
    rectangle AudioTools{
        class AudioCapture {}
        struct Audio {}
        class AudioTransform {}
    }
}

rectangle Visualizer {
    class VisualAggregate {}
    rectangle VisualTools {
        class VisualBuilder {}
        class VisualSerializer {}
        struct VisualRecipe {}
    }
    class VisualProgram {}
    class VisualProgramManager {}
    class WindowManager {}
}

ControllerAggregate --> AudioProcessorAggregate : Manages
ControllerAggregate --> VisualAggregate : Manages
ControllerAggregate --> InitHandler : Uses
ControllerAggregate --> RuntimeHandler : Uses
ControllerAggregate --> ErrorHandler : Uses
InitHandler ..> Event : Subscribes
RuntimeHandler ..> Event : Subscribes
ErrorHandler ..> Event : Subscribes

AudioProcessorAggregate --> AudioCapture : Uses
AudioProcessorAggregate --> AudioTransform : Manages
AudioCapture --> Audio : Captures
AudioCapture --> AudioTransform : Uses
AudioTransform ..> Audio : Transforms
AudioProcessorAggregate ..> Event : Publishes

VisualAggregate --> WindowManager : Uses
WindowManager ..> Event : Publishes
WindowManager ..> VisualProgram : Displays
VisualAggregate --> VisualProgramManager : Uses
VisualProgramManager --> VisualProgram : Manages
VisualProgramManager --> VisualSerializer : Manages
